			"Yo de seguros no sé ná, yo solo friego."],
		"en": ["We’re shut, we’re shut! Come back tomorrow.", "Don’t you dare smear that glass—just buffed it spotless.", "Keep off there, floor’s wet!",
			"Know nowt about policies, love—I just push the mop."]},
	"sopiss_tarareo": {
